in-top:0;\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-av_hr-e20845366ecf4191d9d28e96992d31d2 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-av_hr-e20845366ecf4191d9d28e96992d31d2 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-av_one_half-8cdbb378864195f7b9517e600bbf174b sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-av_one_half-8cdbb378864195f7b9517e600bbf174b av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-mownpsou-f083ab1f2fe976d3179f37446b04f921 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"892\">We are pleased to announce that Venol will participate in the Polish-Egyptian Business Forum taking place on <strong>May 11, 2026<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"1208\">The event will gather representatives of the Foreign Trade Office of the Polish Investment and Trade Agency in Cairo, the Africa and Middle East Department of PAIH, the Embassy of the Republic of Poland in Cairo, Bank Gospodarstwa Krajowego, the Industrial Development Agency, as well as selected Polish companies.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1337\">We are proud to be part of such an important event supporting the development of economic cooperation between Poland and Egypt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1405\">We look forward to meeting and speaking with you during the Forum.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-av_one_half-421c1bf5d4c122db8f22821bc87bc328 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-4  el_after_av_one_half